.  pnmtosir/sirtopnm DO NOT ROUND-TRIP, and this is not fixed.  The image  comes back the right size with its channels ROTATED over the first half of  the pixels: a solid red 4x1 returns as green, green, red, red.  Which of  the pair is at fault cannot be told here -- there is no reference SIR file  to test either one against alone.  Use another format.  INTO the PNM formats (53)  asciitopgm     atktopbm       bioradtopgm    bmptoppm  brushtopbm     cmuwmtopbm     fitstopnm      fstopgm  g3topbm        gemtopbm       giftopnm       gouldtoppm  hipstopgm      hpcdtoppm      icontopbm      ilbmtoppm  imgtoppm       lispmtopgm     macptopbm      mgrtopbm  mtvtoppm       pbmtopgm       pcxtoppm       pgmtopbm  pgmtoppm       pi1toppm       pi3topbm       picttoppm  pjtoppm        pktopbm        ppmtopgm       psidtopgm  qrttoppm       rasttopnm      rawtopgm       rawtoppm  rgb3toppm      sgitopnm       sirtopnm       sldtoppm  spctoppm       spottopgm      sputoppm       tgatoppm  xbmtopbm       ximtoppm       xpmtoppm       xvminitoppm  xwdtopnm       ybmtopbm       yuvsplittoppm  yuvtoppm  zeisstopnm     Zeiss confocal image to PNM  OUT OF the PNM formats (58)  pbmto10x       pbmto4425      pbmtoascii     pbmtoatk  pbmtobbnbg     pbmtocmuwm     pbmtoepsi      pbmtoepson  pbmtog3        pbmtogem       pbmtogo        pbmtoicon  pbmtolj        pbmtoln03      pbmtolps       pbmtomacp  pbmtomgr       pbmtopgm       pbmtopi3       pbmtopk  pbmtoplot      pbmtoptx       pbmtox10bm     pbmtoxbm  pbmtoybm       pbmtozinc      pgmtofs        pgmtolispm  pgmtopbm       pgmtoppm       pnmtoddif      pnmtofits  pnmtops        pnmtorast      pnmtosgi       pnmtosir  pnmtoxwd       ppmtoacad      ppmtobmp       ppmtogif  ppmtoicr       ppmtoilbm      ppmtomap       ppmtomitsu  ppmtopcx       ppmtopgm       ppmtopi1       ppmtopict  ppmtopj        ppmtopjxl      ppmtopuzz      ppmtorgb3  ppmtosixel     ppmtotga       ppmtouil       ppmtoxpm  